# Agent skill runtime state — must never be committed into the package.
# Skills write to $XDG_STATE_HOME/agent-superpowers/ by design; these patterns
# catch anything that leaks back into a skill folder.
.agents/
*/speculative_queue.json
*/speculative_logs/
heat-mode.json

